                            </a>
                            <!-- Instagram -->
                            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/" target="_blank" class="w-10 h-10 bg-gradient-to-tr from-yellow-400 via-red-500 to-purple-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity shadow-lg">
                                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.85.058 1.266.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.85-.058-1.267-.07-1.646-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zm0-2.163c-3.259 0-3.667.014-4.947.072-4.358.2-6.78 2.618-6.98 6.78-.059 1.281-.073 1.689-.073 4.948 0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98 1.281.058 1.689.072 4.948.072 3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.78.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98-1.281-.059-1.69-.073-4.949-.073zm0 5.838c-3.403 0-5.838 2.435-5.838 5.838s2.435 5.838 5.838 5.838 5.838-2.435 5.838-5.838-2.435-5.838-5.838-5.838zm0 10.16c-2.387 0-4.322-1.935-4.322-4.322s1.935-4.322 4.322-4.322 4.322 1.935 4.322 4.322-1.935 4.322-4.322 4.322zm5.446-11.758c.859 0 1.555-.696 1.555-1.555s-.696-1.555-1.555-1.555-1.555.696-1.555 1.555.696 1.555 1.555 1.555z"/></svg>
                            </a>
                            <!-- TikTok -->
                            <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/" target="_blank" class="w-10 h-10 bg-black rounded-full flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors shadow-lg border border-zinc-800">
                                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12.525.02c1.31-.02 2.61-.01 3.91-.02.08 1.53.63 3.09 1.75 4.17 1.12 1.11 2.7 1.62 4.24 1.79v4.03c-1.44-.05-2.89-.35-4.2-.97-.57-.26-1.1-.59-1.62-.93-.01 2.92.01 5.84-.02 8.75-.08 1.4-.54 2.79-1.35 3.94-1.31 1.92-3.58 3.17-5.91 3.21-1.43.08-2.86-.31-4.08-1.03-2.02-1.19-3.44-3.37-3.65-5.71-.02-.5-.03-.99 0-1.49.18-3.4 3.03-6.19 6.44-6.38.54-.03 1.09-.02 1.63.05v4.09c-.45-.06-.9-.07-1.35-.02-1.1.11-2.11.72-2.66 1.65-.4.66-.59 1.46-.57 2.24.03.82.28 1.62.73 2.3.51.77 1.25 1.34 2.12 1.58.7.21 1.48.19 2.15-.02.93-.27 1.73-.89 2.24-1.72.33-.51.48-1.12.53-1.73.07-3.13.04-6.26.06-9.39zm0 0"/></svg>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-8 text-[10px] text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto">
                        <p>
                            This app is made by a solo-preneur, passionate about sports and collections. 
                            This app is not endorsed or affiliated with any of the brands that distribute and otherwise made available the Stickers ("Figurinhas") ou Cards ("Cartas").
                        </p>
                        <p class="mt-2">
                            Desenvolvido e mantido por <a href="https://imbriani.dev" target="_blank" class="text-zinc-500 hover:text-[#e3b341] underline transition-colors">Carlos Alberto Kümpel Imbriani</a>.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-zinc-500 mt-6 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">
                        Powered by Google & Clerk
                    </p>
                </div>
